{"uid":"e5714c0fb82c2534","name":"test_iteration_equivalent_client_is_refused[PATCH-/config/budget]","fullName":"tests.test_control_plane_auth#test_iteration_equivalent_client_is_refused","historyId":"7da51587e9446dd70ca3d28af2153c92","time":{"start":1791889884734,"stop":1791889884774,"duration":40},"description":"The acceptance test's own wording: \"an iteration (stub pi, with the\n    environment a real iteration inherits) fails on every mutating route\".\n    An iteration never has RALPHD_CONTROL_TOKEN (task 003's env-strip\n    covers this coordinate too -- see tests/test_iteration_env_strip.py),\n    so a client presenting no `X-Ralphd-Control-Token` header at all is\n    exactly what an iteration's own HTTP client would be able to build.\n    Asserted per route: a route later added to the wrong listener fails\n    this parametrised case instead of passing by omission.","descriptionHtml":"<p>The acceptance test's own wording: &quot;an iteration (stub pi, with the<br />\nenvironment a real iteration inherits) fails on every mutating route&quot;.<br />\nAn iteration never has RALPHD_CONTROL_TOKEN (task 003's env-strip<br />\ncovers this coordinate too -- see tests/test_iteration_env_strip.py),<br />\nso a client presenting no <code>X-Ralphd-Control-Token</code> header at all is<br />\nexactly what an iteration's own HTTP client would be able to build.<br />\nAsserted per route: a route later added to the wrong listener fails<br />\nthis parametrised case instead of passing by omission.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791889683103,"stop":1791889683103,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791889683103,"stop":17918